01:15.524 --> 01:17.784
For that important thing

01:15.524 --> 01:17.784
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

01:18.044 --> 01:22.454
