01:52.064 --> 01:55.984
Episode 06

01:52.064 --> 01:55.984
Episode 06

01:52.064 --> 01:55.984
Crimson Devil, Ice Queen

01:52.064 --> 01:55.984
Crimson Devil, Ice Queen

01:57.954 --> 02:05.164
<b>Siesta... How did you...
procure such a thing?</b>

02:05.164 --> 02:07.914
<b>Oh, it was just kind of...
lying abandoned in the street?</b>

02:07.914 --> 02:11.634
<b>Don't lie! No way something like
this was lying by the roadside.</b>

02:11.634 --> 02:13.844
<b>I'm telling you, it's true!</b>

02:13.844 --> 02:17.724
<b>There's certainly no way that I got
so disturbed at your being abducted</b>

02:17.724 --> 02:20.054
<b>that I vigorously wrangled
with the government</b>

02:20.054 --> 02:26.894
<b>to borrow Sirius, a humanoid weapon
that had been in covert development.</b>

02:27.934 --> 02:31.234
<b>You've been busier than I thought.</b>

02:31.234 --> 02:35.734
<b>Siesta, you were too,
too desperate to save me.</b>

02:35.734 --> 02:38.904
<b>I told you, that's not what happened.</b>

02:38.904 --> 02:40.404
<b>This is too much.</b>

02:40.404 --> 02:46.164
<b>The way you're going back and forth
so heatedly with my future partner...</b>

02:46.164 --> 02:48.084
<b>...I'm getting jealous.</b>

02:49.714 --> 02:53.294
<b>Hel, why are you fomenting
this sort of terrorism?</b>

02:53.294 --> 03:01.094
<b>Why? It's because it's my destiny.
I merely abide by the Sacred Writ.</b>

03:01.094 --> 03:05.474
<b>No. What I'm asking about
is your own intent.</b>

03:05.474 --> 03:08.604
<b>My intent? That's what I mean--</b>

03:08.604 --> 03:12.444
<b>it's to bring about the future
that's inscribed in the Sacred Writ.</b>

03:12.444 --> 03:15.654
<b>That alone is the meaning of my existence.</b>

03:15.654 --> 03:18.614
<b>I was born only for that purpose.</b>

03:19.574 --> 03:23.664
<b>Is that so? But still...</b>

03:23.664 --> 03:27.834
<b>I won't let you go any further
with your designs for this city.</b>

03:27.834 --> 03:33.004
<b>Do you truly believe you can stop me?</b>

03:33.004 --> 03:34.754
<b>Stop destiny?</b>

03:36.634 --> 03:37.884
<b>Sidekick!</b>

03:40.674 --> 03:42.884
<b>So cramped...</b>

03:45.264 --> 03:48.974
<b>Well, it's made to seat one.</b>

03:48.974 --> 03:51.684
<b>If you take advantage of this as a chance
to touch somewhere unseemly,</b>

03:51.684 --> 03:53.894
<b>you'll earn my full contempt.</b>

03:53.894 --> 03:57.234
<b>Do you have zero faith in your sidekick?</b>

04:03.994 --> 04:08.204
<b>Right, here we go. Sirius, charge!</b>

04:15.294 --> 04:19.214
<b>I never dreamed you'd gone so far
as to create a monster like this.</b>

04:19.214 --> 04:22.474
<b>And as for you, you needlessly impede us.</b>

04:22.474 --> 04:25.224
<b>That's because it's my mission.</b>

04:36.694 --> 04:37.524
<b>Siesta!</b>

04:37.524 --> 04:41.654
<b>It's fine, I won't let them
get away. Hold on.</b>

05:06.384 --> 05:09.604
<b>Rocket... hands!</b>

05:13.274 --> 05:16.524
<b>Shouldn't that tone of voice
be used to say "punch"?</b>

05:16.524 --> 05:18.404
<b>Is there a problem here?</b>

05:23.614 --> 05:26.074
<b>You're just too, too persistent.</b>

05:28.704 --> 05:35.624
<b>You said something earlier...
Impeding us was your mission, you said.</b>

05:35.624 --> 05:41.714
<b>So why do you work as a detective?
Why do you protect people?</b>

05:41.714 --> 05:47.304
<b>It's because you were born for that
particular existence, nothing more.</b>

05:48.634 --> 05:52.604
<b>It's the same. I'm the same.</b>

05:52.604 --> 05:59.314
<b>Just as you were born to defend the world,
I was born to destroy the world.</b>

05:59.314 --> 06:03.574
<b>I'm merely obeying the instincts
I was born with.</b>

06:03.574 --> 06:06.864
<b>So you're saying that we're,
in essence, the same,</b>

06:06.864 --> 06:09.824
<b>and what's more, that there's no
difference between good and evil?</b>

06:09.824 --> 06:14.334
<b>A difference between good and evil?
It doesn't matter to me if there is one.</b>

06:14.334 --> 06:19.294
<b>You're good, I'm evil--
that's fine with me.</b>

06:20.424 --> 06:22.294
<b>I can live with that.</b>

06:31.724 --> 06:33.604
<b>Siesta!</b>

06:33.604 --> 06:35.814
<b>Sidekick...</b>

06:35.814 --> 06:36.974
<b>Now we fly.</b>

06:36.974 --> 06:38.234
<b>Eh?</b>

06:42.734 --> 06:44.944
<b>Engines, full throttle!</b>

06:58.704 --> 07:00.374
<b>Can't allow that!</b>

07:05.964 --> 07:08.094
<b>Sidekick...</b>

07:08.094 --> 07:12.394
<b>Whatever happens after this,
clear out of this place immediately.</b>

07:12.394 --> 07:15.104
<b>Siesta, what are you saying?</b>

07:18.984 --> 07:23.274
<b>Siesta... why?</b>

07:38.624 --> 07:40.834
<b>Siesta!</b>

07:51.594 --> 07:55.934
<b>Siesta... Hey, where are you, Siesta?</b>

07:56.894 --> 07:58.894
<b>Are you stupid or something?</b>

08:00.684 --> 08:07.274
<b>You had no right to say anything before.
You're way too desperate about me, Kimi.</b>

08:11.824 --> 08:17.034
<b>I'm positive I told you before,
whatever happens, to clear out immed--</b>

08:19.204 --> 08:21.834
<b>You're the stupid one.</b>

08:21.834 --> 08:26.544
<b>Why did you act so recklessly?
Why did you send me away?</b>

08:26.544 --> 08:33.474
<b>It was purely as a last resort.
I had no intention of dying here either.</b>

08:33.474 --> 08:38.474
<b>But if only one of us could
survive, in that case, I--</b>

08:38.474 --> 08:40.894
<b>Stop that nonsense!</b>

08:40.894 --> 08:47.404
<b>Listen, three years ago, on that plane,
you asked me to join you.</b>

08:47.404 --> 08:52.654
<b>That being so, you need to look
after me, till the bitter end!</b>

08:52.654 --> 08:57.454
<b>Sorry, but in your absence, I have no
confidence I can escape from SPES.</b>

08:57.454 --> 09:04.084
<b>I can't survive without you!
Do you understand? If you do...</b>

09:04.084 --> 09:08.384
<b>...live up to your obligations
to the very end and protect me!</b>

09:10.344 --> 09:15.264
<b>In my entire life, this is the first time
anyone's ever shouted at me this much.</b>

09:15.264 --> 09:22.394
<b>So you do get worked up like this.
What can I say...?</b>

09:23.524 --> 09:25.434
<b>It makes me smile.</b>

09:26.444 --> 09:29.444
<b>It makes you smile?</b>

09:29.444 --> 09:32.284
<b>"I can't survive without you," huh?</b>

09:32.284 --> 09:35.404
<b>Hey, stop cherry-picking peculiar
phrases out of context.</b>

09:35.404 --> 09:38.744
<b>Once again I've been hit
with an ardent proposal.</b>

09:38.744 --> 09:41.784
<b>I haven't proposed!</b>

09:41.784 --> 09:45.624
<b>Well, once you turn 18,
give it another try.</b>

09:45.624 --> 09:50.334
<b>I told you I-- Whatever.</b>

09:52.674 --> 09:53.924
<b>I vow to you...</b>

09:53.924 --> 09:55.214
<b>Eh?</b>

09:55.214 --> 10:02.014
<b>I won't go off and willfully die without
saying a word to you. Absolutely not.</b>

10:06.354 --> 10:07.774
<b>Sidekick!</b>

10:09.814 --> 10:11.484
<b>Not yet...</b>

10:17.574 --> 10:21.324
<b>I can't die yet.</b>

10:21.324 --> 10:22.744
<b>Hel.</b>

10:22.744 --> 10:27.544
<b>It's not my destiny...
to die in a place like this.</b>

10:27.544 --> 10:32.594
<b>I'm the one who wins in the end. If not...</b>

10:32.594 --> 10:36.214
<b>The significance Father gave
to me respective to this...</b>

10:37.514 --> 10:40.344
<b>I see, you...</b>

10:40.344 --> 10:46.774
<b>With this, I'll finish it. You won't be
able to move a single step from there...</b>

10:46.774 --> 10:49.484
<b>...and my blade will run you through.</b>

10:51.104 --> 10:53.114
<b>Get out of the way, Siesta!</b>

10:54.904 --> 10:57.904
<b>Hel's power... Siesta!</b>

11:14.004 --> 11:16.594
<b>How...?</b>

11:24.934 --> 11:26.724
<b>Checkmate.</b>

11:27.974 --> 11:32.814
<b>Why... did I lose...?</b>

11:32.814 --> 11:38.694
<b>This wasn't supposed to...
I had a mission...</b>

11:38.694 --> 11:43.164
<b>Was fighting for a mission... A mission...</b>

11:43.164 --> 11:49.914
<b>Why was I born? Why was I...?</b>

11:51.914 --> 11:55.544
<b>Find your answers in Hell.</b>

11:56.884 --> 11:58.504
<b>Chameleon!</b>

11:59.884 --> 12:01.384
<b>A partner?</b>

12:07.014 --> 12:08.604
<b>I won't let her escape!</b>

12:11.604 --> 12:14.234
<b>Her body vanished...</b>

12:14.234 --> 12:17.404
<b>Probably a power of the partner
she just called out to.</b>

12:17.404 --> 12:20.194
<b>Chameleon...</b>

12:20.194 --> 12:21.694
<b>Sidekick...</b>

12:24.664 --> 12:26.454
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:43.384 --> 12:45.684
<b>These apples aren't very juicy.</b>

12:45.684 --> 12:48.804
<b>Don't complain when I'm handfeeding you.</b>

12:48.804 --> 12:51.604
<b>There's no way around that, right?
Since I injured myself.</b>

12:51.604 --> 12:55.194
<b>Your leg, yes. Your hands
are available, right?</b>

12:56.314 --> 13:00.524
<b>In the desperate battle of a few
days before, during a fall,</b>

13:00.524 --> 13:04.994
<b>Siesta sustained a leg injury that will
take a couple of weeks to fully heal.</b>

13:04.994 --> 13:09.284
<b>Ordinarily, we'd have needed
to pursue Hel in all haste,</b>

13:09.284 --> 13:13.204
<b>but with Siesta like this,
there's nothing to be done.</b>

13:13.204 --> 13:16.084
<b>Are you all right, Kimi?</b>

13:16.084 --> 13:21.384
<b>Taking diligent care of a self-indulgent
partner like this doesn't faze me.</b>

13:21.384 --> 13:23.514
<b>Oh? That's good.</b>

13:23.514 --> 13:26.344
<b>Don't ignore the sarcasm
I put so much effort into.</b>

13:26.344 --> 13:30.644
<b>I'm fine, but hurry up and recover from
that. I'm no good at domestic work.</b>

13:30.644 --> 13:33.644
<b>We're living together,
just as you've dreamed of.</b>

13:33.644 --> 13:36.024
<b>Shouldn't you enjoy it just a little?</b>

13:36.024 --> 13:39.364
<b>Don't call it "living together."
It's a tactical bunking-up.</b>

13:39.364 --> 13:43.404
<b>Also, it's good that you improve
your practical life skills a little.</b>

13:43.404 --> 13:46.034
<b>What will you do when I'm gone?</b>

13:46.034 --> 13:48.994
<b>Hey, that's off-limits.</b>

13:48.994 --> 13:52.374
<b>That's right; I'm going to
get shouted at again.</b>

13:53.834 --> 13:55.544
<b>Are you going out?</b>

13:55.544 --> 13:58.464
<b>You'd prefer juicier ones, right?</b>

14:01.924 --> 14:05.054
<b>What? Why are you laughing?</b>

14:06.174 --> 14:09.594
<b>Kimi... you like me too,
too much, don't you?</b>

14:09.594 --> 14:15.934
<b>Huh? I don't know what you mean...
Huh? No, just... Wha--?</b>

14:15.934 --> 14:19.904
<b>I had no idea you'd get so flustered.</b>

14:21.314 --> 14:24.074
<b>Shut up, you ignoramus!</b>

14:29.074 --> 14:33.454
<b>Cripes. I'm not going
to spoil her ever again.</b>

14:42.084 --> 14:43.344
<b>Huh?</b>

14:50.934 --> 14:53.434
<b>What to do...</b>

15:00.484 --> 15:05.784
<b>It's been a while since I've gotten
caught up in a mundane problem like this.</b>

15:16.834 --> 15:18.504
<b>Oh...</b>

15:18.504 --> 15:19.754
<b>Hm?</b>

15:21.124 --> 15:24.884
<b>I'm going to be attacked.</b>

15:24.884 --> 15:26.554
<b>Huh?</b>

15:28.424 --> 15:31.344
<b>I'm going to be attacked.</b>

15:31.344 --> 15:35.854
<b>I've got an intensely bad feeling
about this, but I guess I'll ask.</b>

15:35.854 --> 15:38.604
<b>Who are you going to be attacked by?</b>

15:38.604 --> 15:40.774
<b>By you!</b>

15:40.774 --> 15:42.774
<b>However, you might have
your way with me physically,</b>

15:42.774 --> 15:46.154
<b>but if you think you can also take control
of my heart, you're very mistaken!</b>

15:46.154 --> 15:50.864
<b>And I'm immediately hit with
baseless suspicions. This is absurd.</b>

15:50.864 --> 15:55.374
<b>Sorry, but I'm not interested in children.</b>

15:55.374 --> 15:57.744
<b>Who are you calling a child?!</b>

15:59.164 --> 16:02.674
<b>Now, now. Cool down a little.</b>

16:02.674 --> 16:05.794
<b>In this type of situation,
introductions would be a good start.</b>

16:06.754 --> 16:11.134
<b>My name is Kimihiko Kimizuka.
What's yours?</b>

16:11.134 --> 16:14.014
<b>I'm...</b>

16:14.014 --> 16:15.974
<b>...Alicia?</b>

16:15.974 --> 16:20.564
<b>Why was that in question form? Did you
come from Wonderland or something?</b>

16:20.564 --> 16:22.314
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

16:23.944 --> 16:26.694
<b>This conversation is really
lacking in continuity.</b>

16:29.784 --> 16:31.194
<b>Are they good?</b>

16:31.194 --> 16:34.574
<b>Yeah, they're delicious--really sweet!</b>

16:36.494 --> 16:40.334
<b>That's--! Did you eat all of those?</b>

16:41.504 --> 16:43.464
<b>So, where are we?</b>

16:43.464 --> 16:48.674
<b>"Where are we?" Didn't you choose
this yourself as a place to sleep?</b>

16:50.464 --> 16:52.264
<b>I don't know.</b>

16:53.424 --> 16:55.434
<b>Amnesia...</b>

16:55.434 --> 16:56.894
<b>Eh?</b>

16:56.894 --> 16:59.104
<b>Is there anything you remember?</b>

17:00.974 --> 17:05.654
<b>I only remember that I'm
17 years old as of this year.</b>

17:05.654 --> 17:08.734
<b>Hurry up and forget that because
you've definitely got that wrong.</b>

17:10.324 --> 17:12.744
<b>Where are you looking
when you say that?</b>

17:14.454 --> 17:16.994
<b>I took her for an ordinary runaway,</b>

17:16.994 --> 17:20.164
<b>but this seems more
complicated than I thought.</b>

17:20.164 --> 17:22.914
<b>For starters, we're going to the police.</b>

17:40.144 --> 17:42.354
<b>Sidekick? Are you back?</b>

17:42.354 --> 17:47.314
<b>Uh, yeah. And what are you doing?</b>

17:47.314 --> 17:49.944
<b>I thought I'd make apple pie,</b>

17:49.944 --> 17:54.154
<b>since you said you were going out
just to buy more for me.</b>

17:54.154 --> 17:59.624
<b>Ah. Um, so, Siesta... It's just...</b>

17:59.624 --> 18:04.084
<b>Since you seem to care
about me quite a bit,</b>

18:04.084 --> 18:06.964
<b>call it a sense of obligation,
as a crush-ee.</b>

18:06.964 --> 18:10.254
<b>I thought I'd do this much for you.</b>

18:12.004 --> 18:14.214
<b>So where are the apples?</b>

18:14.214 --> 18:17.094
<b>Umm, the thing is...</b>

18:17.094 --> 18:19.094
<b>Kimizuka!</b>

18:21.554 --> 18:24.144
<b>Aren't there any smaller towels?</b>

18:35.694 --> 18:37.284
<b>You lolicon.</b>

18:39.704 --> 18:41.994
<b>Now I understand the situation.</b>

18:41.994 --> 18:44.954
<b>Darjeeling, eh? It smells great.</b>

18:44.954 --> 18:49.254
<b>Yeah. It goes wonderfully with apple pie.</b>

18:49.254 --> 18:53.884
<b>You'd better believe you'll never
see me in an apron again, Kimi.</b>

18:53.884 --> 18:55.844
<b>My, oh my, you can't mean that.</b>

18:55.844 --> 18:59.764
<b>That's the one and only thing I've looked
forward to in life. I am so sad.</b>

19:01.344 --> 19:04.894
<b>Yikes, sorry! I swear I'll
make this up to you later!</b>

19:04.894 --> 19:08.024
<b>This apple-free apple pie is tasty.</b>

19:08.024 --> 19:09.894
<b>Come on!</b>

19:09.894 --> 19:14.524
<b>More pertinently, you should've
brought her to me from the start.</b>

19:14.524 --> 19:17.034
<b>Isn't a missing girl
suffering from amnesia</b>

19:17.034 --> 19:19.994
<b>exactly the sort of thing
for a detective to handle?</b>

19:19.994 --> 19:21.994
<b>True enough.</b>

19:21.994 --> 19:27.044
<b>You said Alicia, right? You really don't
know your own full name or anything?</b>

19:27.044 --> 19:31.214
<b>No, the fact that I'm 17 years old
as of this year is about all.</b>

19:31.214 --> 19:33.044
<b>Seven years old--I see.</b>

19:33.044 --> 19:34.594
<b>Seventeen!</b>

19:34.594 --> 19:38.134
<b>Well, in reality, you must be
about 12 or 13.</b>

19:38.134 --> 19:41.014
<b>That's the sense I get from
the development of her calves.</b>

19:41.014 --> 19:45.644
<b>This is not the place for
showing off your peculiar fetishes.</b>

19:45.644 --> 19:50.694
<b>Alicia, we'll take on the responsibility
of verifying your true identity.</b>

19:50.694 --> 19:53.274
<b>But I'm not saying we'll do it for free.</b>

19:53.274 --> 19:56.654
<b>Hey, Siesta, we're going to
take money from a child?</b>

19:56.654 --> 20:00.704
<b>That's irrelevant; a child still counts
as one human being, and what's more,</b>

20:00.704 --> 20:05.204
<b>I believe nothing is as unreliable
as uncompensated good intentions.</b>

20:05.204 --> 20:07.294
<b>I guess that's true.</b>

20:07.294 --> 20:09.664
<b>What can I do, then?</b>

20:09.664 --> 20:14.424
<b>Alicia, I want you to do the work
of a detective in my place.</b>

20:14.424 --> 20:17.134
<b>The work of... a detective?</b>

20:17.134 --> 20:21.514
<b>Siesta, whatever your intentions,
isn't that too heavy a burden?</b>

20:21.514 --> 20:24.434
<b>That could be, but...</b>

20:24.434 --> 20:28.604
<b>I get it. The legendary detective is
currently closed for business, right?</b>

20:28.604 --> 20:31.144
<b>But in that case, having me
take on the detective role</b>

20:31.144 --> 20:33.694
<b>and Alicia work as sidekick would be--</b>

20:33.694 --> 20:38.654
<b>No, that doesn't... How can I put it?
You just have the face of a sidekick.</b>

20:38.654 --> 20:40.744
<b>That's absurd.</b>

20:40.744 --> 20:45.624
<b>If you've accepted this, we'll commit to
covering your food, clothing, and shelter.</b>

20:45.624 --> 20:50.124
<b>But I'm not sure I have the confidence
to suddenly be a detective.</b>

20:50.124 --> 20:53.874
<b>If you become a detective, you can order
your sidekick around however you please.</b>

20:53.874 --> 20:57.464
<b>Hurray! I'll do it! I want to play
the role of legendary detective!</b>

20:57.464 --> 20:59.924
<b>That was an appalling
negotiation I just watched.</b>

20:59.924 --> 21:03.934
<b>So, specifically, what type
of work should I--?</b>

21:04.884 --> 21:08.684
<b>Our Jack the Ripper seems
to have been resurrected.</b>

21:08.684 --> 21:13.354
<b>Fuubi-<i>san</i>? Why? I thought
you went back to Japan.</b>

21:13.354 --> 21:16.654
<b>Yeah, I recalled some minor business
I had to take care of.</b>

21:16.654 --> 21:18.694
<b>More to the point...</b>

21:18.694 --> 21:21.324
<b>When did you two pop out a child?</b>

21:21.324 --> 21:23.694
<b>--You need to get your eyes checked.
--You should get your eyes checked.</b>

21:25.454 --> 21:28.994
<b>To backtrack, when you say our Jack
the Ripper's been resurrected...</b>

21:28.994 --> 21:33.584
<b>Yup. Yesterday, another new victim
of heart harvesting was discovered.</b>

21:33.584 --> 21:35.504
<b>The M.O. also resembles
the previous cases.</b>

21:35.504 --> 21:39.794
<b>That's madness...
That night, Cerberus was...</b>

21:42.594 --> 21:44.054
<b>Hel.</b>

21:45.514 --> 21:50.474
<b>Truth is, we have some information
that may be useful in pursuing her.</b>

21:50.474 --> 21:54.604
<b>It's still only a rumor,
but we're hearing that an object</b>

21:54.604 --> 21:57.904
<b>that could lead to bringing down
SPES is here in the city.</b>

21:57.904 --> 22:04.444
<b>We're hearing that people refer
to it as... the "Eye of Sapphire."</b>

